// Element-wise $v + and * on 4-bit elements (16 per register), each result
// wrapping mod 16. The reference model returns 0 for every element-wise
// operation on 4-bit elements; the ISA lists $vi4/$vu4 among the vector
// types, and the reference's own $dot ($vi4) works.

||
    $v + $r15 ($vi4) $r1 $r2    // 16 nibbles, each mod 16
    $v * $r16 ($vu4) $r1 $r2    // the low 4 bits of each product
;
|| $halt ;
